rier, statistici si rapoarte vanzări;<br><br>• Variante de produs (atribute) si filtre de căutare avansata;</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-agargzq6\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-nmsmz4w8 uagb-infobox__content-wrap  uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">• GDPR<br><br>• Grafică personalizată<br><br>• Design compatibil cu dispozitive mobile<br><br>• Panou de administrare</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-ootrtgxm\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-3yw8mpiz uagb-infobox__content-wrap  uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">• Galerie foto administrabilă<br><br>• Design logo<br><br>• Funcție tap to chat button<br><br>• Efecte animate<br><br>• 100% design unic</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-xvhjrhhb alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-iqzo7p9k uagb-infobox__content-wrap  uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Servicii diversificate</h2></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-fim0rwaa\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container animated backInUp o-anim-offset-200px uagb-block-4e5aehne\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-b8rhbuf\" data-block-id=\"b8rhbuf\"><style>.stk-b8rhbuf .stk-img-wrapper{width:53% !important;height:332px !important;--stk-gradient-overlay:0 !important;}@media screen and (max-width: 767px){.stk-b8rhbuf .stk-img-wrap